# ITEMFLAG_CRUSH	1000000 (16777216)	can be crushed by tanks!

#Armor
# Armor subtracts itself from damage done
# Objects with negative armor have positive armor vs. everything but fire, no armor vs. fire

#Crush
# When item is placed (or changes states) it does this much damage to each tile it covers

#Permeability (Perm)
# Chance in 255 that a rifle-type projectile will pass through this object

